# UniswapV2Zap module parameters. The contract's only constructor input is `router`; it is NOT
# recorded here, because the Router is deployed by the `dex` repository and arrives as the copied
# addresses.uniswapv2.params (dev-standards §6.2 + §6.3: cross-repository dependencies are read from
# the dependency's own address file, never transcribed into this module's config).
#
# This file therefore exists for two reasons and carries no values:
#   - every module keeps the same shape under script/network/<network>/, so adding a parameter later
#     needs no new file;
#   - 12_deploy_uniswap_v2_zap.sh / 22_check_uniswap_v2_zap.sh load it, so removing it fails loudly.
#
# ROUTER_ADDRESS is read from addresses.uniswapv2.params, copied verbatim from:
#   LOVE20BSC/dex: script/network/anvil31337_dev/addresses.uniswapv2.params
# Re-copy that file after redeploying dex; do not hand-edit the copy.
